  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies the type of event sent by a wallet service to the system wallet.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Use these values with <see cref="T:Android.Service.QuickAccessWallet.WalletServiceEvent" />. <see cref="F:Android.Service.QuickAccessWallet.WalletServiceEventType.NfcPaymentStarted" /> reports that payment has started, not that it has completed.</para>
      <para>Based on the event constants in the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/refs/tags/android-16.0.0_r1/core/java/android/service/quickaccesswallet/WalletServiceEvent.java">Android 16 implementation</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
